node_modules/
dist/
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
.agenthub/state/
.agenthub/*.db*
.agenthub/checkpoint.md
# The hub's shared config is tracked (#1411): config.json (roles, shared defaults) and sdlc.toml. Machine-local values
# (launch commands, gateway URLs, key files, permission modes) live in config.local.json, which wins key by key.
# routing.toml stays local for now: its hub_routes can name a machine's endpoints and the local overlay cannot hold them.
# The first line re-includes the directory for a person whose global gitignore excludes .agenthub/ as a whole.
!/.agenthub/
/.agenthub/*
!/.agenthub/config.json
!/.agenthub/sdlc.toml
.qwen/
.pi-*/
# Python bytecode written by the benchmark tests (scripts/benchmarks/__pycache__); check-docs reads untracked files as dirt
__pycache__/
*.pyc
